{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904150/extras/27f52e391f983b42f9f7110f0c2c4fa5.avif?t=1753828337\" alt=\"Click the Cat 3 Logo\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Click the Cat 3 is a game about clicking a cat. You click, you gain a point. You miss? You die. You take too long? You also die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple gamemodes to choose from, including Standard, Split, Dark Mode, and Restless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global high score for every difficulty of every gamemode. Can you set a new record?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple achievements to hunt for.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it all yours with unlockable cat skins, backgrounds and cursors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular updates! <strong>Much more to come...</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904150?t=1753828337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904150?t=1753828337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904150/0b08468f2b5cc7a2161b89d65fd2033b5b338a49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753828337","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904150/0b08468f2b5cc7a2161b89d65fd2033b5b338a49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753828337","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904150/extras/27f5